  <data name="settingsPrivacyBody" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The rendezvous server, the relay and Cloudflare's STUN server see your IP address, and so does the other device when you connect directly (unless privacy mode is on). None of them sees file names, contents or keys, and our servers keep no logs. Files go directly between the devices when they can, otherwise through the relay; they are encrypted end to end either way.</value>
